**/sketches/
# Per-run gene-level artifacts. The collected tables in this directory
# (plan, metrics, genome-all, genes-joined-all, resources-all) are tracked on purpose.
simulations/gene-level/results/mutated_*/

*.gs
*.skc
*.gdsk

*.tmp
*.Rhistory
*.pdf
*.png

# Benchmark runs: the reference outputs under resource-benchmarking/output-<seed>/
# are tracked on purpose (plot-resource.R reads their resources.tsv, and
# run_benchmarks.sh skips methods already recorded there); this line only keeps
# future runs out of the index.
resource-benchmarking/output-*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
dist/
build/
.venv/
venv/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Tool intermediates / local run outputs
*.delta
*.1delta
*.coords
*.paf
*.blastn6
*_db.*
windows.fa

# Local workdirs / scratch outputs (keep scripts, not runs)
**/*_work/
**/.work_*/

# Compiled helpers from scripts/Makefile (sources are tracked, binaries are not)
/scripts/estimate-sample-ani
/scripts/dip-only
/scripts/dip-pairs
/scripts/reconcile-gdiff-sample
/scripts/summarize-gdiff-sample

# Global reusable sketch/cache tree (large binaries)
**/.cache/
